# 🌾 Crop Advisory System

A weather-based crop advisory chatbot for farmers in Kumbakonam, Tamil Nadu.
Combines live weather data with an LLM (via Groq) to give crop- and
weather-specific farming advice, with multi-language translation support.

## Setup

Add your Groq API key as a Space secret named `GROQ_API_KEY`
(Settings → Variables and secrets).
